@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ub: <http://lubm.example.org/> .
ub:Faculty a owl:Class .
ub:Department a owl:Class .
ub:worksFor a owl:ObjectProperty .
ub:Department1 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Department .
ub:FacultyOf1 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Faculty ; owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ub:worksFor ; owl:hasValue ub:Department1 ] .
ub:Department2 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Department .
ub:FacultyOf2 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Faculty ; owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ub:worksFor ; owl:hasValue ub:Department2 ] .
ub:Department3 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Department .
ub:FacultyOf3 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Faculty ; owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ub:worksFor ; owl:hasValue ub:Department3 ] .
ub:Department4 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Department .
ub:FacultyOf4 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ub:Faculty ; owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ub:worksFor ; owl:hasValue ub:Department4 ] .